    "notes": "A flat mounting bracket, 50 x 30 x 5.5 mm, with four Ø5 holes on a 40 x 20 pitch, cut out of a 60 x 40 x 6 plate of 6082. The cutter runs round the edge of the plate, so hold it down on a sacrificial board with double-sided tape, not clamps: the holes and the outline go 0.3 mm into the board. Face the top, spot and drill the holes, then cut the outline with four holding tabs; break the tabs and file them flush."
